  year={2026},
  volume={},
  number={},
  pages={1-3},
  abstract={This work presents a low-jitter and low-power mm-wave cascaded PLL that leveraging the $2^{\text{nd}}$ harmonic extraction and $5^{\text{th}}$ harmonic-mixing to improve the jitter performance. The 54-60GHz PLL prototyped in 28nm CMOS achieves an excellent jitter-power figure of merit $\left(\text{FoM}_{\mathrm{N}}\right)$ below −280dB, while the jitter performance (53.8fs) is very competitive.},
